{"id":"n59453-1-12","stage":3,"title":"분류 · 分类","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59453-1-12-1","ko":"이 글은 아무 데나 올려도 되겠지?","zh":"这条帖子随便发到哪里都可以吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"글은","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글은","audio":"/audio/1c7c01b523937bba3ae6.mp3"}},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}},{"text":"데나","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데나","audio":"/audio/54d68f53c48a317f5854.mp3"}},{"text":"올려도","meaning":"发，发上，上传","explanation":"올리다：发，发上，上传；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"15","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려도","audio":"/audio/a99941ccbc9419afed3a.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠지?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠지","audio":"/audio/eac871c1e6b95daa61f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3","entryId":"59226","definition":"将想法或事情等用文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["글"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"ff5095d829513a79","term":"올리다","zh":"发，发上，上传","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3","entryId":"22109","definition":"在计算机通讯网或互联网新闻上登载文件、文章或报道等。","pronunciation":["올리다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e791e362bd62b7ee2ffe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59453-1-12-2","ko":"안 돼요. 게시판 분류 기준에 맞게 올려야죠.","zh":"不行哦。必须按照公告板的分类标准来发布。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}},{"text":"게시판","meaning":"网络论坛","explanation":"게시판：网络论坛","readings":[{"term":"게시판","audio":"/audio/4732a58f5f977c4b3be7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15943","senseId":"2","lemma":"게시판","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게시판","audio":"/audio/4732a58f5f977c4b3be7.mp3"}},{"text":"분류","meaning":"分类，归类","explanation":"분류：分类，归类","readings":[{"term":"분류","audio":"/audio/4b6d64452264bbca6819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59453","senseId":"1","lemma":"분류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분류","audio":"/audio/4b6d64452264bbca6819.mp3"}},{"text":"기준에","meaning":"标准，基准","explanation":"기준：标准，基准；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"기준","audio":"/audio/eaea55bff60093748aab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61091","senseId":"1","lemma":"기준","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기준에","audio":"/audio/c42687254f6b1632e991.mp3"}},{"text":"맞게","meaning":"合适，合乎，对","explanation":"맞다：合适，合乎，对；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"5","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞게","audio":"/audio/c3bb076cd0a1f673ec8c.mp3"}},{"text":"올려야죠.","meaning":"发，发上，上传","explanation":"올리다：发，发上，上传；어야죠：어야지요的缩合，表示“应该、必须”或确认应当如此。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"15","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려야죠","audio":"/audio/8f31fc829e9f98853710.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},